{
  "id": 8498,
  "title": "微调与检索增强生成",
  "meta_title": "微调与 RAG 方法对比",
  "meta_description": "对比直接微调模型与使用检索增强生成获取专门知识的差异。",
  "content": "<p>当你部署一个预训练 (pre-training)的小语言模型时，很快就会发现它缺乏关于私有数据或特定任务的专门知识。为了填补这一空白，工程师通常依赖两种主要方法：微调（Fine-Tuning）和检索增强生成（RAG）。在投入计算资源进行训练之前，必须理清这两种方法的差异。</p>\n<p>检索增强生成将语言模型视为推理 (inference)引擎，而非事实数据库。当用户提交查询时，系统首先搜索外部数据库（通常是向量 (vector)库）以寻找相关文档。这些文档会被附加到用户提示词 (prompt)中。随后，小语言模型完全基于这些注入的上下文 (context)来生成答案。</p>\n<p>我们可以将 RAG 中的提示词构建表示为一个简单的函数：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>最终</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>用户</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>检索</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>嵌入</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>用户</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{最终}} = P_{\\text{用户}} + \\text{检索}(D, \\text{嵌入}(P_{\\text{用户}}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">最终</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">用户</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">检索</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">嵌入</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">用户</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>这里，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>最终</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{最终}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">最终</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是发送给模型的提示词，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>用户</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{用户}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">用户</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是原始查询，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span> 代表外部文档库。模型不会学习新的参数 (parameter)，其权重 (weight)保持不变。这使得 RAG 在信息更新频繁的场景（如新闻汇总或客户支持文档）中表现出色。如果某个事实发生了变化，你只需要更新数据库即可。</p>\n<p>微调则采用了完全不同的方式。微调不是在推理阶段提供上下文，而是修改模型本身的内部结构。通过让网络处理特定的“指令-回答”对并计算损失，利用梯度下降 (gradient descent)算法来更新模型权重。</p>\n<p>权重的更新改变了模型词表生成的概率分布。如果你专门针对法律合同训练模型，那么生成法律术语的概率就会增加。知识和风格模式直接嵌入 (embedding)到了参数之中。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-s012ax\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph G { rankdir=TB; node [shape=box, style=filled, fontname=\"Helvetica\"]; subgraph cluster_rag { label=\"检索增强生成\"; style=filled; color=\"#e9ecef\"; Q1 [label=\"用户查询\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"]; DB [label=\"向量数据库\", fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\"]; P1 [label=\"组合提示词\", fillcolor=\"#b2f2bb\"]; M1 [label=\"静态小语言模型\", fillcolor=\"#bac8ff\"]; R1 [label=\"回答\", fillcolor=\"#d8f5a2\"]; Q1 -> DB [label=\"搜索\"]; Q1 -> P1; DB -> P1 [label=\"上下文\"]; P1 -> M1; M1 -> R1; } subgraph cluster_ft { label=\"微调\"; style=filled; color=\"#e9ecef\"; D2 [label=\"训练数据集\", fillcolor=\"#ffec99\"]; T [label=\"训练循环\\n(权重更新)\", fillcolor=\"#fcc2d7\"]; M2 [label=\"更新后的小语言模型\", fillcolor=\"#bac8ff\"]; Q2 [label=\"用户查询\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"]; R2 [label=\"回答\", fillcolor=\"#d8f5a2\"]; D2 -> T; T -> M2; Q2 -> M2; M2 -> R2; } }' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-s012ax\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>在推理阶段提供上下文与在训练阶段改变模型权重之间的架构差异。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>为了做出合理的架构决策，你必须评估首要目标。RAG 是知识注入的最佳选择。如果你正在构建一个用于回答庞大员工手册相关问题的系统，RAG 是合适的方案。小语言模型不需要背诵手册，只需在运行时阅读提供给它的特定段落。</p>\n<p>微调则是行为调整的最佳选择。如果你希望小语言模型读取自然语言查询并输出有效的 SQL 字符串，微调的效果会更好。模型会学习语法、表结构以及预期的格式规范。由于这些行为已经固化在模型中，你可以节省提示词占用的空间，不需要在每次用户请求时都提供 SQL 语法示例。</p>\n<p>例如，从运行成本来看：RAG 会带来延迟，因为系统在生成文本前必须查询数据库。微调虽然需要前期的训练计算成本，但由于提示词更短且无需调用外部数据库，推理速度通常更快。</p>\n<p>你也可以结合这两种技术。先进 AI 系统中常见的一种模式是：先微调一个小语言模型使其遵循特定的输出格式，然后使用 RAG 向其提供填充该格式所需的具体事实。这种混合方案能发挥两者的长处，同时规避各自的短板。</p>",
